# Beer Express — bloqueia acesso direto a arquivos internos
Options -Indexes
<FilesMatch "^(\.env.*|\.be_versao|config\.php|install\.sql|cron_tick\.php|.*\.(md|log|sql))$">
  Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
RedirectMatch 403 ^/?(.*/)?migrations/

AddType application/vnd.android.package-archive .apk
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  <FilesMatch "\.apk$">
    Header set Content-Disposition "attachment"
  </FilesMatch>
</IfModule>
